English translation of the original Japanese commit message:

ci(release-npm): skip lifecycle scripts during publishing

Add --ignore-scripts to real and dry-run npm publish commands in
.github/workflows/release-npm.yml. Remove the prepublishOnly hook from
crates/flexaudio-napi/package.json as well. That hook ran napi
prepublish,
which attempted to create a GitHub release and publish platform packages
again, conflicting with the workflow's explicit publishing steps.
Platform packages are still published before the main package.
